317
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:59,000
Thanks so much.

318
00:24:59,000 --> 00:25:04,000
Ann Jean, as a visitor, could you lead us in the Pledge of Allegiance, please?

319
00:25:04,000 --> 00:25:10,000
I pledge allegiance to the flag of the United States of America and to the Republic for

320
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:25,000
which it stands, one nation, under God, indivisible, with liberty and justice for all.

321
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:30,000
The committee does not have its chair or vice chair again tonight.

322
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:35,000
They have both called in and given reasons for their absence.

323
00:25:35,000 --> 00:25:41,000
So I would entertain a motion from the committee to appoint a chair to govern the savings meeting.

324
00:25:41,000 --> 00:25:43,000
I motion for Sheila Lowes to be chair tonight.

325
00:25:43,000 --> 00:25:44,000
I have a motion for Sheila.

326
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:45,000
Second that.

327
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:46,000
Second.

328
00:25:46,000 --> 00:25:47,000
Is there any discussion?

329
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:52,000
I guess I did okay last time.

330
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:53,000
We concur, Sheila.

331
00:25:53,000 --> 00:25:55,000
All those in favor, show of hands.

332
00:25:55,000 --> 00:25:56,000
Fantastic.

333
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,000
Thank you so much.

334
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,000
It's unanimous.

335
00:25:58,000 --> 00:26:01,000
And Sheila, I will turn the meeting to you for the approval of minutes.

336
00:26:01,000 --> 00:26:02,000
Yay, yay.

337
00:26:02,000 --> 00:26:03,000
Okay.

338
00:26:03,000 --> 00:26:07,000
We have approval of minutes on September 10th, 2026.

339
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:08,000
Regular meeting revised.

340
00:26:08,000 --> 00:26:10,000
I'm looking for a motion.

341
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:15,000
And who had the revision and is it done?

342
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:16,000
I don't remember.

